WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.340
India often speaks for developing

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.078
countries. In 2023,

3
00:00:04.078 --> 00:00:05.915
that went from words to

4
00:00:05.915 --> 00:00:08.039
a seat at the table.

5
00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.247
The first India–Africa Forum Summit

6
00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:13.043
was held in 2008.

7
00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:13.911
In 2023,

8
00:00:13.911 --> 00:00:16.366
under India's G20 presidency,

9
00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:18.595
the African Union became a

10
00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:20.509
permanent member.

11
00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:22.573
India also hosted the first

12
00:00:22.573 --> 00:00:24.178
Voice of the Global South

13
00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:27.953
Summit, in January 2023.

14
00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:30.095
Through lines of credit and

15
00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:31.539
training programmes,

16
00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:33.747
and through vaccines and disaster

17
00:00:33.747 --> 00:00:34.764
relief.

18
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.278
Your turn.

19
00:00:36.278 --> 00:00:38.221
Which body joined?
